<Slide style={{
  width: '1280px', height: '720px',
  background: '#FAF7F2', padding: '40px 60px 20px',
  flexDirection: 'column',
}}>
  {/* A 标题区 */}
  <Box style={{ marginBottom: 12 }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, marginBottom: 4 }}>
      <Box style={{ background: '#8B1A1A', borderRadius: 6, padding: '4px 10px' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#fff' }}>组合秘籍 · 全书最高热度</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6B6B6B' }}>第二章 · 组合秘籍</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2B2B2B' }}>
      为什么 <span style={{ color: '#8B1A1A' }}>27 / 37 / 38</span> 最强？
    </Text>
  </Box>
  {/* B 内容区 - 左大图+右侧文字 */}
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24, flex: 1, height: 500 }}>
    {/* 左侧：SVG 辐射图 55% */}
    <Box style={{ flex: 55, background: '#FFFEF8', borderRadius: 16, padding: 20, border: '1px solid #eee4d2', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3a2a1a', textAlign: 'center' }}>
        以 <span style={{ color: '#1A7F5C' }}>2万</span> + <span style={{ color: '#C9A227' }}>7万</span> 为例：两张牌如何"辐射"覆盖 1-9
      </Text>
      <svg width={600} height={400} viewBox="0 0 600 400">
        {/* 顶部：两张锚牌 */}
        {/* 2万 */}
        <rect x="60" y="20" width="60" height="75" rx="8" fill="#FFFEF8" stroke="#1A7F5C" strokeWidth="3" />
        <text x="90" y="52" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="28" fontWeight="bold" fill="#1A7F5C">2</text>
        <text x="90" y="72" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="13" fill="#1A7F5C">万</text>
        <text x="90" y="14" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#1A7F5C" fontWeight="bold">辐射到 1,3,4</text>
        {/* 7万 */}
        <rect x="480" y="20" width="60" height="75" rx="8" fill="#FFFEF8" stroke="#C9A227" strokeWidth="3" />
        <text x="510" y="52" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="28" fontWeight="bold" fill="#C9A227">7</text>
        <text x="510" y="72" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="13" fill="#C9A227">万</text>
        <text x="510" y="14" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#C9A227" fontWeight="bold">辐射到 5,6,8,9</text>
        {/* 连接线：2 → 1,3,4 */}
        <path d="M 90 95 Q 50 180 40 320" fill="none" stroke="#1A7F5C" strokeWidth="2" opacity="0.5" />
        <path d="M 90 95 Q 130 180 170 320" fill="none" stroke="#1A7F5C" strokeWidth="2" opacity="0.5" />
        <path d="M 90 95 Q 160 180 235 320" fill="none" stroke="#1A7F5C" strokeWidth="2" opacity="0.5" />
        {/* 连接线：7 → 5,6,8,9 */}
        <path d="M 510 95 Q 420 180 300 320" fill="none" stroke="#C9A227" strokeWidth="2" opacity="0.5" />
        <path d="M 510 95 Q 450 180 365 320" fill="none" stroke="#C9A227" strokeWidth="2" opacity="0.5" />
        <path d="M 510 95 Q 530 180 495 320" fill="none" stroke="#C9A227" strokeWidth="2" opacity="0.5" />
        <path d="M 510 95 Q 560 180 560 320" fill="none" stroke="#C9A227" strokeWidth="2" opacity="0.5" />
        {/* 中间：可组成的顺子 */}
        <text x="300" y="170" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="13" fill="#999">2 能组 123、234</text>
        <text x="300" y="190" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="13" fill="#999">7 能组 567、678、789</text>
        {/* 底部：1-9 全覆盖 */}
        {(() => { const nums = [1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9]; const xs = [40,105,170,235,300,365,430,495,560]; return nums.map((n,i) => (
          <g key={i}>
            <rect x={xs[i]-22} y="310" width="44" height="56" rx="6" fill="#F0FBF5" stroke="#1A7F5C" strokeWidth="1.5" />
            <text x={xs[i]} y="338" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" fill="#1A7F5C">{n}</text>
            <text x={xs[i]} y="356" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="11" fill="#1A7F5C">万</text>
            <text x={xs[i]} y="385" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="10" fill="#1A7F5C" fontWeight="bold">
              {n===2||n===7 ? '锚牌' : '✓ 已覆盖'}
            </text>
          </g>
        )); })()}
        {/* 全覆盖标注 */}
        <text x="300" y="395" textAnchor="middle" fontSize="14" fontWeight="bold" fill="#1A7F5C">
          两张牌 → 覆盖 1-9 全部数字！这就是"辐射到极致"
        </text>
      </svg>
    </Box>
    {/* 右侧：文字解释 45% */}
    <Box style={{ flex: 45, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ background: '#FFFEF8', borderRadius: 12, padding: 20, border: '1px solid #eee4d2' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2B2B2B', marginBottom: 10 }}>
          什么是<span style={{ color: '#8B1A1A' }}>"辐射"</span>？
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4a4038', lineHeight: 1.8 }}>
          "辐射"就是<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#8B1A1A' }}>一张牌能和多少个数字组顺子</span>的能力。<br /><br />
          <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A7F5C' }}>2万</span> 能组 123、234 → 辐射到 1、3、4<br />
          <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#C9A227' }}>7万</span> 能组 567、678、789 → 辐射到 5、6、8、9<br /><br />
          两张牌加起来 → <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#8B1A1A' }}>1-9 全部覆盖</span>，只剩 2 和 7 本身（那是你手里的牌）！
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ background: '#FFF5F0', borderRadius: 12, padding: 16, border: '1px solid #f5d5c5' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#8B1A1A', marginBottom: 6 }}>
          ⚠️ 千万别拆！
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4a4038', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
          民间说法"<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>3、7 张不能随便打</span>"。一旦拆开 27/37/38，威力倍减——你的 AI 现在拆强组合会被<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#8B1A1A' }}>重罚分</span>。
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(201,162,39,0.08)', borderRadius: 8, padding: 14, border: '1px solid #e8d8a8' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#6b5636', lineHeight: 1.6, fontStyle: 'italic' }}>
          "27、37、38 这 3 种组合效率最高，辐射效果都达到了极致"<br />
          <span style={{ fontSize: 12, opacity: 0.7 }}>——《理论册》第 3 节 · 108 人划线（全书最高热度）</span>
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ background: '#F0FBF5', borderRadius: 8, padding: 10, border: '1px solid #c3e6d3' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#1A7F5C' }}>
          ✅ 代码实现：<span style={{ fontFamily: 'monospace', fontSize: 12, background: '#e8f5ee', padding: '2px 6px', borderRadius: 4 }}>isStrongCombo()</span> + <span style={{ fontFamily: 'monospace', fontSize: 12, background: '#e8f5ee', padding: '2px 6px', borderRadius: 4 }}>brokenStrongCombos()</span> 已接入复盘引擎
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  {/* C 页脚 */}
  <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'flex-end', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 12 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#a0a0a0' }}>08 / 16</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
